WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.863 --> 00:00:10.493
You've signed in, you select Invite Teacher, and it won't let you send. This video explains the three most common reasons, and what to do about each.

2
00:00:10.995 --> 00:00:19.935
The most common reason is a banner that says, License payment pending. Invitations can't be sent until your school's invoice is marked paid.

3
00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:26.387
If you try anyway, you'll see a message that the school license isn't active yet. Nothing was sent.

4
00:00:26.889 --> 00:00:45.369
If you paid by card, this clears right away. If you pay by purchase order, invitations open as soon as we record that your signed purchase order has arrived. You don't have to wait for payment. Until then, the banner says we're waiting for your purchase order. Email us and we'll check where yours stands.

5
00:00:45.871 --> 00:01:00.861
The second reason is that your seats are full. Pending invitations count as used seats, so if you've invited as many people as you have seats, there's no room for more. On your dashboard, a red message says, No licenses remaining.

6
00:01:01.363 --> 00:01:06.853
Revoke an invitation you don't need, to free its seat, or email us to add seats.

7
00:01:07.353 --> 00:01:22.663
The third is a license that isn't fully set up yet, which is common with a trial. A trial license may not have a school domain or school record attached, so a few features, such as branding and safety alert recipients, will say that they aren't set up.

8
00:01:23.164 --> 00:01:27.484
When your school moves to a full license, we'll finish that setup for you.

9
00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:36.077
If none of these fits, email support at Fixer Nation Education dot com, and tell us the exact message you see on the screen.
